# Project invariants

Follow `docs/guides/project-rules.md` and `docs/guides/security.md`.

## Must remember
- **DoD:** feature is not done without green tests, no secrets in git, and a clear OK/not-OK report to the user.
- **Prototype vs product:** new work only in `frontend/` + `backend/`. Root HTML is reference/GitHub Pages only — not real auth or real data.
- **Security:** server enforces authz; hiding UI is not security. Prefer secure cookies for web sessions; hash passwords; validate all inputs.
- **Product constants:** Persian RTL UI, Toman amounts, Jalali dates in UI.
- **Money:** changing plan price must not rewrite past payments/memberships; income ≠ debt.
- **Delivery:** vertical slices; API under `/api/v1`; audit log for financial/membership/role changes; Postgres backups before real member data.
